네, 저는 멀티 에이전트 시스템에서 작동할 수 있는 코드를 작성할 수 있습니다!

다양한 언어로 멀티 에이전트 시스템 코드를 만들어 드릴 수 있어요:

## Python (Python 3.x)
```python 
import asyncio

class MultiAgentSystem:
    def __init__(self):
        self.agents = []

    def add_agent(self, agent):
        self.agents.append(agent)

    async def run_agents(self):
        tasks = [agent.run() for agent in self.agents]
        await asyncio.gather(*tasks)

class Agent:
    def __init__(self, name):
        self.name = name

    async def run(self):
        print(f"Agent {self.name} is running...")

async def main():
    system = MultiAgentSystem()

if __name__ == "__main__":
   asyncio.run(main()) 
```

## JavaScript (Node.js)
```javascript 
class MultiAgentSystem {
  constructor() {
      this.agents = [];
  }

  addAgent(agent) {
      this.agents.push(agent);
  }

  async runAgents() {
      const promises = this.agents.map(agent => agent.run());
      await Promise.all(promises);
  }
}

class Agent {
   constructor(name) {
       this.name = name;
   }

   async run() {
       console.log(`Agent ${this.name} is running...`);
   }
}
```

## Java (Java SE)
